[{"client_msg_id":"6bfd147b-edb7-43db-9131-302f328f5bff","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"出来がる式がイメージしやすいのがポイント高いですね。私はマクロじゃなくても、よくバッククオート使います。","ts":"1618153178.133000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DTy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47495500-39ed-45cc-a839-416539cc1aac","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://typescript-jp.gitbook.io/deep-dive/future-javascript/spread-operator\u003e\n\u003chttps://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/blob/aed5089d3bde92c5e9bde7018fc38758bdb5ea4f/src/coc.ts#L17-L21\u003e\n少ないですかねぇ。。TSの`...`演算子とか`,@`と同じ使い方なことに気付きました。\n\n```  context.subscriptions.push(\n    ...registerCommands(commands),\n    ...registerProcesses(commands),\n    ...registerFunctions(commands)\n    )```\n```(let ((registerCommands '(a b c))\n      (registerProcesses '(d e))\n      (registerFunctions '(f g h)))\n  `(,@registerCommands ,@registerProcesses ,@registerFunctions))\n;;=\u0026gt; (a b c d e f g h)```\n","ts":"1618153126.132700","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim","id":1,"title":"yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim","title_link":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/blob/aed5089d3bde92c5e9bde7018fc38758bdb5ea4f/src/coc.ts#L17-L21","text":"The plugin that powerfully integrates fzf and (Neo)vim. It is also possible to integrate with coc.nvim. - yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim","image_url":"https://repository-images.githubusercontent.com/125713913/f7001780-57a9-11eb-910f-a664093bf49f","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/blob/aed5089d3bde92c5e9bde7018fc38758bdb5ea4f/src/coc.ts#L17-L21","original_url":"https://github.com/yuki-yano/fzf-preview.vim/blob/aed5089d3bde92c5e9bde7018fc38758bdb5ea4f/src/coc.ts#L17-L21"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lEG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6afe44be-3af7-4e4e-ba4f-464705f51902","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"別の使い所が少ないのも不幸の始まり","ts":"1618152944.132000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gR9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65923ca2-5d5b-4682-9c39-960c971f6db2","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"先入観怖い","ts":"1618152913.131600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rzFc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4a19312-6178-4e34-b4f8-2ebc68673ae4","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":":sorena:","ts":"1618152909.131400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6dar"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fc4e26d3-5fe1-4418-86c6-2372b75bb809","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://www.mew.org/~kazu/doc/elisp/backquote.html\u003e\n\u0026gt; バッククオートの不幸は、いつもマクロと一緒に語られることである。 だから、「バッククオートはマクロで使うものだ」と変な先入観を持たされてしまう。","ts":"1618152840.131200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0T4=I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c5f45ea-5934-43a5-9bd3-2fd273164913","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですね。ただbackquote、マクロ用と思うと別の使い所を見失ってしまうので初学者に教えるときは注意ですね。","ts":"1618152781.130600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FrF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d726892f-d8ff-457b-a426-ea696e8c472a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"半分くらいマクロ用機能な気がしてる","ts":"1618152698.130400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L/E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1aca3e9-d962-4ac5-81c5-f04d34baa66d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですね。評価器に入れて出力した結果を、さらに評価器に入れるのとかがすごく素直に書けます。","ts":"1618152683.130100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/n/0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aac8f1a1-9114-4287-ac6c-c910f355342c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"見た目が爆発するのもわかる","ts":"1618152624.129900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/irL2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84e63f73-71f6-4ae0-8d52-eb3d81994f21","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"式とプログラムの境界が無いLispだからこその機能ではあるんだろうな","ts":"1618152617.129700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fYR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dcef2254-d85c-4894-a810-84953e88d8b1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"```(value ,(list '\\` `(,mmap ,mstr ,command* ,',(and old (not (numberp old)) old) ,path))))```","ts":"1618152549.128900","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1618152557.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LD7m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea33ca1c-8bf7-4f21-94a3-76123cddc83c","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"leafはこの機能をめちゃくちゃ使っていて、所々やばい見た目になっている。\n\u003chttps://github.com/conao3/leaf.el/blob/ab5cc26b56a6a53a3338ebfde17b746522c2c14c/leaf.el#L840\u003e","ts":"1618152540.128500","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: conao3/leaf.el","id":1,"title":"conao3/leaf.el","title_link":"https://github.com/conao3/leaf.el/blob/ab5cc26b56a6a53a3338ebfde17b746522c2c14c/leaf.el#L840","text":"Flexible, declarative, and modern init.el package configuration - conao3/leaf.el","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4703128?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":400,"thumb_height":400,"from_url":"https://github.com/conao3/leaf.el/blob/ab5cc26b56a6a53a3338ebfde17b746522c2c14c/leaf.el#L840","original_url":"https://github.com/conao3/leaf.el/blob/ab5cc26b56a6a53a3338ebfde17b746